{"title":"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integers</a> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b64827154bf51d07786e0328f25c572732ad2862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^5 = b^4$\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/9/be9faf5934f36e65155f0efd12cae00c3fff4a12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^3 = d^2$\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c9d6ab775497ee41b71cf71ef7e0aa7785e4c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c - a = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />. Determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4be74446a2f4c73e7b2b4cc7c7c290a951d78b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d - b$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It follows from the givens that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perfect_power\" title=\"Perfect power\"> perfect fourth power</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is a perfect fifth power, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perfect_square\" title=\"Perfect square\">perfect square</a> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perfect_cube\" title=\"Perfect cube\">perfect cube</a>.  Thus, there exist <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae4609f3c608d34ffb786756f0626fa38bad067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = t^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/42434ca346a876f32a95130fd71188762e054c22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = t^5$\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/6/fa655a6bd681443b5d1e0f8a7729026da641aefd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = s^2$\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/6/2569f6981379e4b728a53b14b74ddfea9e47f2a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = s^3$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/c/94ca7537f38b683ba8ed6a861ed334a8ce60d897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^2 - t^4 = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />.  We can factor the left-hand side of this <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a> as a difference of two squares, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/e/66eded275ff72c0105549ec42aadab977615428a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(s - t^2)(s + t^2) = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"19\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime_number\" title=\"Prime number\">prime number</a> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fa65dd48eb6c9b84a017845aebf2a5dd3e6d6b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s + t^2 &gt; s - t^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"16\" /> so we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/4/2e4ea6ad6626e9f91129fdcf1b1c10283e19e70c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s + t^2 = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f42ee7fb4657b0bef62664fea1e7bdf0d79f919.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s - t^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9df736b4060a97519228b5bb2dae682831f3f17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 10, t = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /> and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15ce90490c6d275e2a172a5b988f372b41efef38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = s^3 = 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/6/0e6c2d8fc53048b9a1277085c7990e4ce8e6cbf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = t^5 = 243$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/4/04488d883c1ad513bca74522afe98d490cb417eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d-b=\\boxed{757}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/euz1azVKUYs?t=709\">https://youtu.be/euz1azVKUYs?t=709</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME\" title=\"1985 AIME\">1985 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\">AIME Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination\" title=\"American Invitational Mathematics Examination\">American Invitational Mathematics Examination</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017175031\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 217/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1431/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4798/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.515      1 Template:AIME_box\n100.00%    7.515      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2796:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017175031 and revision id 257797. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}